@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@memberToken = 替换为买家登录返回的token
@adminToken = 替换为管理员登录返回的token
@devKey = 替换为本地开发密钥

# 本文件为逐步手工演示；将响应中的ID和业务号填入后续请求。
# 所有金额均为整数分。不要把真实凭证保存或提交到仓库。


### 注册（每次使用新的用户名）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"learning_buyer_01","password":"replace_with_your_password"}

### 买家登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"learning_buyer_01","password":"replace_with_your_password"}

### 管理员登录，密码来自本地环境配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"replace_with_your_admin_password"}

### 新增地址，记下返回的 id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"receiver":"学习买家","phone":"13800000000","province":"浙江","city":"杭州","district":"西湖","detail":"演示地址","defaultAddress":true}

### 查看自己的地址
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 退出后旧 token 不再有效
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
